*** Test Cases ***

[1]CB009915-C-IWK16_with_Dynamic_RIM-RS_Allocation_From_Resource_Pool_xxMhz_SA
    TC_CB011028-EI3    ${params}    ${Vendor_Param}    ${List_UEs}    ${List_Cells}    ${L1pool_Conf}    ${List_L1Subpool}
    [Teardown]            Setup.Test Teardown



*** Keywords ***

TC_CB011028-EI3
    [Documentation]       CB009915 Basic Call
    [Arguments]           ${params}    ${Vendor}    ${UEs}    ${Cells}    ${L1Pool}    ${L1Subpool}
    Set Suite Variable    ${params}
    Init Sequence         ${params}
    Step                  Set RAD Params for CB009915
    Step                  Update Vendor File Config For bbL1SpPrbInitCapacity And bbPoolCapacity for ASOE
    Step                  Set CB009915 Context TDD SA
    Step                  Restart.F1 Wait Link Classical
    ${listOfUes}          Build UEs list SA Multi UEs
    Step                  Set UE_Capa Context_WTS CFG           listOfUes=${listOfUes}
    Step                  Multi Cells Setup for CB009915        listOfUes=${listOfUes}
    Step                  SA Start Traffic Multi UEs NonGBR     listOfUes=${listOfUes}
    Step                  Get L1L2 Logs
    Step                  Check Rim Rs in L1L2 by Cell with Blanking
    Step                  Check Generic Messages
    Step                  Get TTI Logs
    Step                  Check Prb Pooling DL in TTI
    Step                  Check Prb Pooling UL in TTI
    Step                  Check 9915 PM Counters
    Step                  SA DeRegister Multi UEs               listOfUes=${listOfUes}
    [Teardown]            Display diagnosis

